                                "example_id": "03759765-37d7-4b38-a0a3-e0558960c088",
                                "sense_id": "5c453f44-a3d9-3e9b-8a2f-2dc7971a3427",
                                "text": "Could a Taff'ta ſcarf, a long Eſtridge vvhing, / A ſtiffe Iron Doublet, and a Brazeel Pole / Tempt thee from Cambrick ſheets, fine active Thighs, / From Caudles vvhere the precious Amber ſvvims?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b089b9b-1f89-4147-87c5-b92e8d0bf962",
                                "sense_id": "5c453f44-a3d9-3e9b-8a2f-2dc7971a3427",
                                "text": "we incamped in two Lines about 60 yards apart the Right whing in frunt Commanded by General Butler, the Left in the Rear which I commanded"
                            },
